    "Probe branches are mutually exclusive: either legacy target/field/outputName/rows or columns/rows, with factCut/scopedFacts present together. Every column spec contains exactly target/field/outputName; malformed, unknown, missing, positional and mixed-shape inputs refuse.",
    "Columns are nonempty and at most256; enumerate assigns one-based positions. The unchanged original checker verifies actual resolved output order/name/source, outcome classes/provenance, cells and optional scoped-fact selection.",
    "Before repeated inspect_column construction, checked addition/multiplication reserves serialized original input plus rendered output for every selected column against16M. Actual exact16,000,000 control succeeds; one extra serialized source byte across8 columns produces16,000,008 and refuses. This is selected source expansion accounting, not total heap/CPU.",
    "34 new current-binary controls pass, including256 original columns,257 refusal, one-column array, legacy/new shape exclusion, paired facts, reordered columns/cells, arity, mixed outcome/value types, correct two-row batch and late second-row original-value forgery with empty stdout.",
    "41 unchanged legacy fact/cell controls independently rerun on the new binary pass. These cover the previous single-column paired/unpaired path, source/refinement/scan/fact/value failures and bounds.",
    "Native combined statement projects resourceId then salary simultaneously from the same q.sid/q.rid predicate/filter result, joining the outer resource by global native identity. Exact ordered pair comparison precedes dictionary storage, preventing duplicate or omitted pairs from being hidden.",
    "Nine independent retained-artifact checks pass: parent source/binary/artifact hashes, original source model pins, original renderer replay, exact combined SQL reconstruction, finite pair completeness and exact combined cell order matching the per-field cells.",
    "Parent full8 native suite42.528s and16 boundaries pass. The native test sends the actual combined cells through the original owner and rejects swapped cells, declarations, missing cells and a late valid-domain forged original value without stdout."
  ],
